export IDX_READ IDX_RESERVE IDX_CAPACITY
# =====================================================================
#  xmssidx.la — the durable leaf-index register for XMSS.
#
#  WHY THIS EXISTS: A REUSED INDEX IS A BROKEN KEY.
#  XMSS is STATEFUL. Each of the 2^h leaves holds a WOTS+ one-time key, and
#  signing twice under one leaf leaks that leaf's secret — an attacker who sees
#  two signatures from the same index can forge. So the index is not
#  bookkeeping; it is part of the private key.
#
#  ★ AND IT IS THE ONE DEFECT CLASS A GATE CANNOT SEE BY ACCIDENT. `xmss.la`
#  is green on nine checks and would stay green forever with no index tracking
#  at all, because NOTHING IN A TEST REUSES AN INDEX. Every signature verifies;
#  the key is destroyed anyway. That is why this module ships with a gate that
#  DELIBERATELY exhausts and deliberately re-reads, and why `wotsp.la`'s
#  negative-control discipline is not enough here — the failure is not a wrong
#  answer, it is a correct answer given twice.
#
#  ── THE ORDERING IS THE WHOLE DESIGN ────────────────────────────────
#  IDX_RESERVE writes the ADVANCED index to disk BEFORE returning the index to
#  be signed with. Because the language is call-by-value, a caller written as
#      (la i. SIGN(i)(msg))(IDX_RESERVE(path)(h))
#  cannot sign before the write completes — the argument is evaluated first.
#  Reverse those two steps and a crash between signing and writing reuses an
#  index, which is the exact catastrophe this module exists to prevent. So the
#  failure mode is deliberately asymmetric: a crash after the write LOSES a
#  signature slot (harmless, 2^h-1 remain) and never reuses one. Losing a slot
#  is a cost; reusing one is a break. The gate asserts this direction, because
#  a register that advanced lazily would pass every ordinary test.
#
#  ── A MISSING STATE FILE MUST HALT, AND read_file GIVES THAT FOR FREE ─
#  `read_file` on an absent path halts loudly (exit 1), so there is no way in
#  pure Lingua Adamica to probe for existence without halting — and that is
#  CORRECT here, not a limitation worked around. A register that created its
#  file on first read would, if the file were ever lost or restored from an old
#  backup, silently restart at 0 and REUSE EVERY INDEX. Refusing to sign when
#  the state is missing is the only safe behaviour. The state file is therefore
#  created once, deliberately, when the keypair is created — never by a signer.
#
#  ── WHAT THIS DOES NOT GIVE YOU — the honest boundary ────────────────
#  * NO fsync. `write_file` is the only primitive available on both engines, so
#    the write reaches the OS but not provably the platter. A power loss can
#    lose it, and then the register goes BACKWARDS — the one direction that
#    breaks the key. Closing this needs an fsync builtin; until then the
#    guarantee is "survives process death", not "survives power loss", and
#    those are different guarantees.
#  * NO concurrency control. Two signers sharing one state file can interleave
#    read-then-write and both take the same index. Single-writer only. An
#    O_EXCL lockfile would need builtins the host does not have.
#  * It does not make reuse UNREACHABLE, only unreachable through this path.
#    `xmss.la`'s XMSS_SIGN still takes an explicit index and a caller can pass
#    whatever it likes; the guard is the discipline of going through
#    IDX_RESERVE, not a type-level impossibility. Stated rather than implied.
# =====================================================================

glyph IF   = la c. la t. la f. c(t)(f)("!")
# SEQ forces its first argument before yielding its second. Under call-by-value
# naming `a` is what performs the write; this is the ordering primitive the
# write-ahead discipline above rests on.
glyph SEQ  = la a. la b. b
glyph POW2 = la h. bshl(1)(h)

glyph IDX_CAPACITY = la h. POW2(h)
glyph IDX_READ = la path. str_to_int(read_file(path))

# IDX_RESERVE: hand out the next unused index, having FIRST persisted the
# advance. Halts loudly when the key is spent rather than wrapping to 0 —
# wrapping would silently reuse every index in the tree, which is precisely the
# catastrophe. Loud failure is the project's discipline and here it is also the
# only safe option.
glyph IDX_RESERVE = la path. la h.
    (la i.
      IF(lt(i)(POW2(h)))
        (la _. SEQ(write_file(path)(int_to_str(add(i)(1))))(i))
        (la _. error("xmssidx: key exhausted — all 2^h leaf indices used; a new keypair is required, and REUSING one would leak the leaf secret")))
    (IDX_READ(path))

# =====================================================================
#  WITNESS — pure index logic, no hashing, so this costs seconds rather
#  than the hours xmss.la's gate costs. The register is separable from the
#  signature scheme, so it is verified separately and cheaply; only the
#  integration needs the expensive path.
# =====================================================================
glyph P = "xmssidx_test.state"
glyph H = 2

glyph MARK = la ok. la name. IF(ok)(la _. concat(name)(" OK"))(la _. concat(name)(" WRONG"))

glyph RUN =
  # Deliberately start from a known state so the run is reproducible. A signer
  # must NEVER do this; only a keypair-creation step may.
  SEQ(write_file(P)("0"))
  ((la a. (la b. (la afterTwo. (la discarded. (la afterDiscard.
      concat(concat(concat(concat(
        concat("xmssidx h=2: ")(MARK(int_eq(a)(0))("first=0")))
        (concat(" | ")(MARK(int_eq(b)(1))("second=1"))))
        (concat(" | ")(MARK(NOT_EQ(a)(b))("no reuse"))))
        (concat(" | ")(MARK(int_eq(afterTwo)(2))("advance persisted"))))
        (concat(concat(" | ")(MARK(int_eq(discarded)(2))("third=2")))
               (concat(" | ")(MARK(int_eq(afterDiscard)(3))("unused slot LOST not reissued")))))
      (IDX_READ(P)))
      # ★ Reserve and then throw the index away without signing. The register
      # must NOT hand index 2 out again: a crash between reserving and signing
      # has to lose a slot, never duplicate one. A lazily-advancing register
      # passes every other check here and fails exactly this one.
      (IDX_RESERVE(P)(H)))
      (IDX_READ(P)))
      (IDX_RESERVE(P)(H)))
      (IDX_RESERVE(P)(H)))

glyph NOT_EQ = la a. la b. IF(int_eq(a)(b))(la _. FALSE_)(la _. TRUE_)
glyph TRUE_  = la t. la f. t
glyph FALSE_ = la t. la f. f

glyph MAIN = print(RUN)
